== Effect ==
* Gives Isaac 100 {{e|Penny|text=Pennies}}.
** This does not extend past the normal cap of 99.

== Notes ==
* A Dollar can only be found from paying out a {{M|Slot Machine}}, as a starting item for {{c|Eden}}, using {{i|Spindown Dice}} on {{i|Boom!}}, by using {{i|Death Certificate}}, or by using {{p|0 - The Fool?}} with {{i|Deep Pockets}} and at least 100 coins.
** Multiple copies of A Dollar can be found in the same run from paying out different {{m|Slot Machine}}s.
* Rerolling this item with the {{i|D4}}, etc., will not remove the coins acquired.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Deep Pockets}}: Allows Isaac to gain the full 100 coins.
* {{i|Bag of Crafting}}: The item cannot be crafted.

